# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
dev-dist
coverage
*.local

# webOS .ipk build output (regenerated with `ares-package webos`).
dist-webos/

# Build output served by the Caddy proxy (infra/). Regenerated from `dist/`,
# so it's ignored just like dist/ — see infra/docker-compose.yml for how to populate it.
infra/www/
# Rollback backup of the previous bundle, recreated on every deploy (see infra/deploy.sh).
infra/www.bak/

# EmulatorJS runtime for "modo gamer" — 289 MB of third-party cores and wasm,
# fetched by infra/fetch-emulatorjs.sh. `infra/www/` above already covers the
# served copy; it is spelled out because that rule exists for build output and
# someone narrowing it must not accidentally start committing a third of a
# gigabyte. `.emulatorjs/` is the download cache that survives deploy swaps.
infra/www/emulatorjs/
infra/.emulatorjs/

# Infra secrets (the *arr API keys the BFF holds). Never commit.
infra/.env

# Agent tooling scratch (skill registry / local agent state).
.atl/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Deploy backups, OTA apk, local override and runtime state
infra/www.bak*/
infra/updates/*.apk
infra/docker-compose.override.yml
infra/music-worker/data/
infra/bff/data/
# webOS pairing keys — a credential the TV hands out once. Never commit these.
infra/cast-bridge/data/

# Python bytecode from the music worker (regenerated on every run)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
infra/.env.bak-*
